{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.luca.second",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她说了一样你弄不到的东西",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.luca.second",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.luca.second",
    "idolId": "luca",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "又",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "吵起来了。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……今天带了热的。还有甜的东西。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "────知道了就滚啊……那些东西我不要。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "滚…………滚啊……………………！",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……你那边的经纪人已经飞走了。公司也把辞呈收下了。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……可是你还在这个房间里。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……想吃点什么？能弄到的我都去弄。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "ナポリタン",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……拿坡里意面？那个能弄到。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "不是那个。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "────一样你这辈子都弄不到的东西。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "『妈妈做的拿坡里意面』",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "滚吧……………………",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "你每来一次……东西就少一点。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "一点一点地被夺走……然后就没有了──────────",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "『谁都不在』",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "『安静的时间』",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "『我，还剩下的那部分』",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "────────滚啊………………！",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "text": "门没有开。走廊里只剩下加热过的便当慢慢变凉的味道。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……那我下次再来。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "啊",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "好寂寞啊",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────"
      }
    }
  },
